<item><title>Women become majority of Rwanda&apos;s tertiary students</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/rw/women-become-majority-of-rwanda-s-tertiary-students-55c569/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/rw/women-become-majority-of-rwanda-s-tertiary-students-55c569/</guid><category>Rwanda</category><description>Women made up 51.8% of tertiary-level students in 2024, reversing the balance recorded in 2017.</description><pubDate>Mon, 23 Nov 2026 08:34:18 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/rw.jpg" length="31934" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/rw.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
